	(text "- J1 CAN + 24 V field, 4-way 3.5 mm pluggable: 1 +24V, 2 GND, 3 CANH, 4 CANL\n- J2 UP (top face) / J3 DOWN (bottom face), 2x8 shrouded 2.54 mm, 16-way IDC, straight through:\n  1 +24V  2 +24V  3 GND  4 GND  5 CANH  6 CANL  7 GND  8 GND\n  9 spare  10 GND  11-15 TSOP1-5  16 GND\n- J5 indicator (bottom face), 4-way JST-XH: 1 +24V, 2 R-, 3 G-, 4 B-\n- TPD4E05U06 ESD arrays at J2 and J3\n- Population: top rail J2 DNP, middle J1 DNP, bottom J3 / J5 DNP"
